                  "value" : "已调整 %lld 个值以符合均衡器的限制。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A band boosts or cuts one frequency, on top of the Graphic sliders. Add one below, or double-click the graph where you want it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "频段可在图形均衡滑块的基础上提升或衰减某个频率。可在下方添加，也可在图表中双击所需位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gentle lift at both ends and a slightly recessed midrange, for orchestral and chamber music." : {
      "comment" : "Built-in preset description: Classical",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻柔提升低频和高频，略微收敛中频，适合管弦乐和室内乐。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heavy low end with slightly pulled-back mids and a little air on top." : {
      "comment" : "Built-in preset description: Hip-Hop",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加强低频，略微收敛中频，并为高频增添一些通透感。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A softened bottom and a warm midrange, for relaxed background listening." : {
      "comment" : "Built-in preset description: Lounge",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "柔和低频与温暖中频，适合轻松聆听或作为背景音乐。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AUTO" : {
      "comment" : "Automatic gain switch, written in capitals as a badge",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
