          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjusted" : {
      "comment" : "Import sheet status: value changed",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Audio Access" : {
      "comment" : "Menu bar extra row: opens Settings to give the audio permission",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许访问音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow…" : {
      "comment" : "Button: asks macOS for the audio permission, which shows its prompt",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An equalizer has to reach the sound to change it. CoreEQ reads audio on its way to your speakers, adjusts it, and plays it straight back. Nothing is recorded, stored, or sent anywhere, and quitting CoreEQ hands the audio back immediately." : {
      "comment" : "What the audio permission is for, shown before macOS asks",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡器需要访问音频才能调整声音。均衡器会读取传往扬声器的音频、进行调整并立即播放。均衡器不会录制、存储或发送任何内容；退出后，音频会立即恢复原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another App Has Exclusive Access" : {
      "comment" : "Menu row: an unnamed app holding an output device to itself"
    },
    "Another app has exclusive access to “%@”, so its sound isn’t being equalized. The equalizer returns when that app lets go." : {
      "comment" : "Engine status: an unnamed app holds an output device to itself"
    },
    "Another copy of CoreEQ is running." : {
      "comment" : "Alert title at launch, when CoreEQ is already running",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡器的另一个副本正在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps turned on below play straight to the output, without EQ." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在下方开启的应用会直接输出声音，不经过均衡处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At login, CoreEQ opens in the menu bar, without a window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "登录时，均衡器会在菜单栏中启动，不显示窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio Diagnostics" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音频诊断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio Permission Needed" : {
      "comment" : "Menu bar extra row: the permission was refused; opens Settings",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要音频权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AutoEq" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AutoEq"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AutoEq publishes correction curves for a large catalog of headphones and earphones. Its web app can write a correction as an EqualizerAPO parametric EQ, which CoreEQ imports." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AutoEq 为大量耳机发布校正曲线。它的网页应用可以将校正结果导出为 EqualizerAPO 参数均衡格式，供均衡器导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AutoEq sent an unexpected response." : {
      "comment" : "AutoEq error",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AutoEq 返回了意外的响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AutoEq sent data CoreEQ couldn’t read." : {
      "comment" : "AutoEq error",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AutoEq 返回了均衡器无法读取的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic gain" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动增益"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Band %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "频段 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
