          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreEQ couldn’t download AutoEq data (HTTP %lld). Try again." : {
      "comment" : "AutoEq error: the number is the HTTP status code",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡器无法下载 AutoEq 数据（HTTP %lld）。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreEQ couldn’t download AutoEq data from GitHub. Check your internet connection and try again." : {
      "comment" : "AutoEq error",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡器无法从 GitHub 下载 AutoEq 数据。请检查网络连接并重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreEQ couldn’t identify its own audio output, so it can’t leave itself out of what it captures. It’s leaving your sound alone and will try again." : {
      "comment" : "Engine failure: CoreEQ couldn’t find its own audio process",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡器无法识别自己的音频输出，因此无法在采集时排除自身。均衡器不会处理你的声音，并会重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreEQ couldn’t set up the audio path (error %d)." : {
      "comment" : "Engine failure: a Core Audio call failed; the number is its error code",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡器无法设置音频路径（错误 %d）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreEQ equalizes the sound you hear. Nothing is recorded, stored, or sent anywhere." : {
      "comment" : "Audio permission explanation, when it’s granted",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡器会调整你听到的声音。不会录制、存储或发送任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CoreEQ hasn’t needed the permission yet, so there’s nothing to report." : {
      "comment" : "Audio permission explanation, before CoreEQ has asked",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
