    "The preset “%@” no longer exists." : {
      "comment" : "Export error",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预设“%@”已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system audio arrived in a format CoreEQ can’t equalize: it needs 32-bit floating-point samples." : {
      "comment" : "Engine failure: the audio tap delivered an unsupported sample format",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统音频的格式无法由均衡器处理：需要 32 位浮点采样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trim is computed from the chain; turn this off to set it by hand" : {
      "comment" : "Automatic gain help tag, while on",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输出补偿根据滤波链计算；关闭此项可手动设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There’s no published correction CoreEQ supports for this measurement." : {
      "comment" : "AutoEq error",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有适用于此测量数据且受均衡器支持的已发布校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are kept exactly, as parametric bands beyond the sliders’ ±12 dB range. You can clip their gains to ±12 dB instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些参数均衡频段超出滑块的 ±12 dB 范围，但已按原样保留。也可以将增益限制在 ±12 dB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Treble" : {
      "comment" : "Quick EQ slider: high frequencies",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on CoreEQ under Screen & System Audio Recording, then choose Quit & Reopen when macOS asks." : {
      "comment" : "Permission instructions. “Quit & Reopen” is the button macOS shows; use its translation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“屏幕与系统音频录制”中开启均衡器，然后在 macOS 询问时选择“退出并重新打开”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on CoreEQ under Screen & System Audio Recording. If it’s already on, turn it off and on again: an update gives CoreEQ a new signature, and macOS keeps the old entry. Then relaunch CoreEQ." : {
      "comment" : "Permission instructions, when macOS can’t say whether it was refused",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“屏幕与系统音频录制”中开启均衡器。如果已经开启，请先关闭再重新开启：更新会为均衡器生成新的签名，而 macOS 仍保留旧记录。然后重新启动均衡器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn the equalizer off" : {
      "comment" : "Power button help tag",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭均衡器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn the equalizer on" : {
      "comment" : "Power button help tag",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启均衡器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two copies would each silence the other’s sound, so only one can run." : {
      "comment" : "Alert message: why two copies of CoreEQ can’t run together",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同时运行两个副本会让它们互相静音，因此只能运行一个。"
