    },
    "Waiting for the audio permission" : {
      "comment" : "Warning icon, for VoiceOver",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在等待音频权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm bass, slightly recessed mids, and an airy top, for small-group recordings." : {
      "comment" : "Built-in preset description: Jazz",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温暖的低音、略微收敛的中音和通透的高音，适合小型乐队录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What CoreEQ sees on this Mac. Include it with a bug report: it answers most questions about audio problems. It names your audio devices, your presets, and any apps you’ve excluded, and contains nothing else about you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均衡器在这台 Mac 上检测到的信息。提交错误报告时请附上此报告，它能解答大多数音频问题。报告包含音频设备、预设和已排除的应用名称，不含其他个人信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where AutoEq asks which equalizer you use, choose EqualizerAPO’s parametric EQ." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AutoEq 询问所用均衡器时，请选择 EqualizerAPO 的参数均衡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
